  "description": "\"What about you, Assistant Manager Gong? Do you think you could do it with someone you're not dating?\"\n\nGong Yeonji, the supposedly \"unappetizing\" woman from Sales Team 1.\n\nAt the worst moment of her life, when the person she secretly loved mocks her and she realizes she's been used all along, Kang Taeha, the most popular assistant manager in the company, unexpectedly comes to her rescue.\n\n\"Ah, I...\"\n\nJust as she opened her mouth, the man's hand suddenly reached toward her.\n\nHis long, slender fingers brushed her cheek before touching the frame of her glasses.\n\n\"I think I could do it, if it were you, Assistant Manager Gong.\"\n\nStartled, she trembled as he gently removed her glasses, his fingers grazing her temple.\n\nIs this pity or love?\n\nTaeha, a man whose true intentions are impossible to read, tells her:\n\n\"So just trust me and follow my lead. I'll get to savor the delicious Assistant Manager Gong, and you'll become prettier thanks to me.\"\n\nAnd so, Taeha takes it upon himself to restore the self-esteem of Yeonji, an innocent and straightforward woman.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \nR19: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=9960907), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/unusualpleasure_19), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/daeri_manjok)  \nR15: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=9960859), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/unusualpleasure_15), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/daeri_manjok_15)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \nR15: [French](https://www.webtoons.com/fr/romance/plaisir-inhabituel/list?title_no=5953), [Japanese](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0003240)",
